"Make the dimple for the stalk with the forefinger.",
"Observe that in the Apple its sides are convex. Therefore fill it up to this shape with pieces of clay, smoothing with the tool.",
"Smooth the surface with the wet thumb.",
"Put in the stalk bending to one side."
